  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_01",
      "hash64": "60E84D9A515A901A",
      "text": "Another day, another round of battle study! Osu!\\nLet’s get right to it![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_02",
      "hash64": "60E84C9A515A8E67",
      "text": "Last time, we learned about Tera Raid Battles!\\nDid any of you have a chance to try them out?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_03",
      "hash64": "60E84B9A515A8CB4",
      "text": "Tera Pokémon are super strong! And the more\\ndifficult ones will use an even tougher tactic that\\r\\nyou’ll need to deal with.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 124,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_04",
      "hash64": "60E84A9A515A8B01",
      "text": "I’m talking about their [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Tera Shield[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_05",
      "hash64": "60E8499A515A894E",
      "text": "What happens while a Pokémon has its\\nTera Shield up, you ask?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_06",
      "hash64": "60E8489A515A879B",
      "text": "Well, it’ll take WAAAY less damage, for one![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_07",
      "hash64": "60E8479A515A85E8",
      "text": "It has a big effect on morale, too![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_08",
      "hash64": "60E8469A515A8435",
      "text": "When Trainers see that shield go up, they feel\\ndoomed—like there’s no way to win the battle![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_09",
      "hash64": "60E8459A515A8282",
      "text": "So, here’s a question for you![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_10",
      "hash64": "60E4C89A51577844",
      "text": "If the Pokémon you’re battling puts up its Tera\\nShield, what should you do?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "AB71E26C3F620374",
      "text": "Close your eyes and give in",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "AB71E56C3F62088D",
      "text": "Call your parents",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_e_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "AB71E46C3F6206DA",
      "text": "Terastallize and attack it",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_01",
      "hash64": "956C446586DBA4F3",
      "text": "What?! Don’t just accept defeat! You should be\\nable to find a way out of this predicament if you\\r\\nkeep on fighting![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 117,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_02",
      "hash64": "956C456586DBA6A6",
      "text": "What?! Don’t call your family to tell them you’re\\nabout to lose! You should be able to find a way\\r\\nout of this predicament if you keep on fighting![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_answer_03",
      "hash64": "956C466586DBA859",
      "text": "That’s right! You’re a regular Tera Raid Battle\\nmaster, aren’t you, new kid?[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_11",
      "hash64": "60E4C99A515779F7",
      "text": "Regular attacks don’t work so well against\\nPokémon that have their Tera Shield up.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_12",
      "hash64": "60E4CA9A51577BAA",
      "text": "But having your Pokémon Terastallize is an\\neffective method to overcome that issue!\\c\\nA Terastallized Pokémon will do more damage\\nto shielded Pokémon—especially if it uses moves\\r\\nthat match its Tera Type![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 207,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_13",
      "hash64": "60E4CB9A51577D5D",
      "text": "Dealing enough damage to a Pokémon with its\\nTera Shield up can destroy the shield and break\\r\\nthe Pokémon’s stance![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_14",
      "hash64": "60E4C49A51577178",
      "text": "This means that it’s important to properly time\\nyour Terastallizing in Tera Raid Battles.[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_15",
      "hash64": "60E4C59A5157732B",
      "text": "In conclusion![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_16",
      "hash64": "60E4C69A515774DE",
      "text": "As they say, fight fire with fire and Tera\\nPokémon with Tera Pokémon![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_17",
      "hash64": "60E4C79A51577691",
      "text": "Be sure to work together with your teammates to\\nsmash through your opponent’s Tera Shield![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_18",
      "hash64": "60E4C09A51576AAC",
      "text": "Aw, man! I was just about to suggest we do some\\nhands-on practice to really drive the point home,\\r\\nbut I guess we’re out of time once again...[VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_e_03_battle_19",
      "hash64": "60E4C19A51576C5F",
      "text": "Next class will be our midterm exam! Aim for a\\nperfect score! Osu! Osu![VAR 0x0114(0024)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0024"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
